[00:17.56]1. Doubt and fear surround me—
[00:25.96]The way ahead not clear.
[00:31.40]Through uncertainty you guide me;
[00:36.84]I know you’re always near.
[00:39.86]Life may not be easy,
[00:42.87]But this I know is true:
[00:46.27]You’re the God who’s ever loyal;
[00:52.89]My life is safe with you.
[00:56.77](Chorus)
[01:00.65]Jehovah, give me eyes of faith
[01:04.53]And help me always see
[01:08.41]There are more with us than against us.
[01:12.28]Courageous let me be.
[01:17.18]Courage, give me courage;
[01:21.48]With courage, I’ll endure.
[01:26.58]Jehovah, give me courage;
[01:31.68]Your victory is sure.
[01:40.12]2. Feeling fear is human.
[01:44.12]In my own strength, I’m frail.
[01:49.12]You have been my rock and refuge;
[01:52.80]Your power never fails.
[01:56.30]Help me be courageous,
[01:59.80]And let my heart be brave.
[02:05.44]Lasting harm can never hold me—
[02:11.08]No prison, gate, or grave.
[02:16.72](Chorus)
